.TH "CITADEL" "1" "Sep 2026" "AceTeam" "Citadel CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
citadel-mcp - Start a local MCP server for AI tool integration


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcitadel mcp [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes AceTeam tools
to Claude Code, Cursor, and other AI development tools.

.PP
The MCP server reads JSON-RPC messages from stdin and writes responses to
stdout, bridging your local AI tools to the AceTeam platform.

.PP
Authentication uses an AceTeam API key. Generate one at:
  https://aceteam.ai/settings/api-keys

.PP
The API key is read from (in priority order):
  1. --api-key flag
  2. ACETEAM_API_KEY environment variable
  3. the node's device config saved by 'citadel init' (device_api_token)

.PP
Usage with Claude Code:
  claude mcp add aceteam -- citadel mcp

.PP
Usage with Cursor (add to .cursor/mcp.json):
  {"mcpServers": {"aceteam": {"command": "citadel", "args": ["mcp"]}}}

.PP
Usage with environment variable:
  ACETEAM_API_KEY=act_xxx claude mcp add aceteam -- citadel mcp


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	AceTeam API key (or set ACETEAM_API_KEY env)

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	AceTeam API URL (default: https://aceteam.ai)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for mcp

.PP
\fB--server\fP="aceteam"
	MCP server name to proxy (default: aceteam)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug output

.PP
\fB--no-auto-update\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic update checks and installs for this run (or set CITADEL_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable colorized output

.PP
\fB--node-dir\fP=""
	Override the node config directory (citadel.yaml + services/), bypassing $HOME/ConfigDir resolution. Also settable via CITADEL_NODE_DIR. Scope: manifest/services resolution only -- does NOT redirect network state, the module lockfile, or nodevault.

.PP
\fB--runtime\fP=""
	Container runtime for module containers: docker or podman (default: auto-detect)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcitadel(1)\fP
